WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.553
Puss had his new, fancy boots.

2
00:00:11.554 --> 00:00:14.064
He gazed in a mirror.

3
00:00:14.065 --> 00:00:18.494
"I look fabulous!" he said.

4
00:00:18.495 --> 00:00:21.936
"Those boots are nice," Carabas said.

5
00:00:21.937 --> 00:00:24.847
"But why do you need them?"

6
00:00:24.848 --> 00:00:30.033
Puss smiled. "Master, I must look my best.

7
00:00:30.034 --> 00:00:36.306
That is how a cat gets respect."

8
00:00:36.307 --> 00:00:39.679
Puss picked up a bag.

9
00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:44.816
"I will be back later," he said.

10
00:00:44.817 --> 00:00:49.598
"Where are you going?" Carabas asked.

11
00:00:49.599 --> 00:00:57.419
"I have a plan, remember?" Puss said.

12
00:00:57.420 --> 00:01:03.296
Puss went outside.

13
00:01:03.297 --> 00:01:06.161
Carabas scratched his head.

14
00:01:06.162 --> 00:01:09.402
"Puss is special," he thought.

15
00:01:09.403 --> 00:01:14.827
"But he's also very strange!"

16
00:01:14.828 --> 00:01:21.805
Outside, Puss got a carrot from the garden.

17
00:01:21.806 --> 00:01:29.620
He dropped it into the bag.

18
00:01:29.621 --> 00:01:34.791
Then he headed down the road.

19
00:01:34.792 --> 00:01:38.382
Puss came to a meadow and stopped.

20
00:01:38.383 --> 00:01:42.535
"This spot is perfect!" he said.

21
00:01:42.536 --> 00:01:46.244
He put the bag on the ground.

22
00:01:46.245 --> 00:01:54.143
Then he hid behind a bush and waited.

23
00:01:54.144 --> 00:01:57.746
Soon a rabbit came along.

24
00:01:57.747 --> 00:02:00.589
It sniffed the bag.

25
00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:02.456
Puss grinned.

26
00:02:02.457 --> 00:02:05.558
"Yes, Mr. Rabbit," he thought.

27
00:02:05.559 --> 00:02:08.326
"First, smell that carrot.

28
00:02:08.327 --> 00:02:12.264
Next, climb into the bag!"

29
00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:18.742
The rabbit stuck its nose in the bag.

30
00:02:18.743 --> 00:02:21.416
It crawled in farther . . .

31
00:02:21.417 --> 00:02:27.670
Puss pounced. "Got you!"

32
00:02:27.671 --> 00:02:31.692
Puss quickly tied up the bag.

33
00:02:31.693 --> 00:02:35.866
"Master might like this rabbit for dinner," he said.

34
00:02:35.867 --> 00:02:42.779
"But I have other plans!"

